Ab tumhara GitHub repo ekdum professional aur ready-to-impress lagega! Padhne ke baad batao, backend ka code likhna shuru karun? 🚀

giginore file
Bhai, .gitignore file bahut zaroori hai. Agar tum isse nahi banoge, toh tumhari venv folder (jisme hazaron files hoti hain), node_modules (jo bahut heavy hota hai), aur sabse khatarnak—tumhari .env file (jisme Gemini API Key hai) GitHub pe upload ho jayegi.

Bots tumhari API key chura lenge aur account block ho jayega.

Tumhare project ke hisaab se ek perfect .gitignore file maine neeche di hai.

Kaise banayein?
Apne VS Code mein project ke root folder mein (agme-memory-engine ke andar) ek nayi file banao jiska naam rakho: .gitignore (shuru mein dot zaroor lagana).
Usme neeche diya gaya pura code copy-paste kar do aur save kar do.

