# ==========================================
logs/
*.log
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ==========================================
# 7. Misc
# ==========================================
docker-compose.override.yml
⚠️ Ek Important Step (Agar galti se API key push ho gayi ho)
Agar tumne pehle hi git add . karke apni .env file GitHub pe push kar di hai, toh sirf .gitignore banane se kaam nahi chalega. Tumhe us file ko Git ki memory se nikalna hoga.

Terminal mein ye command chalao:

powershell
# Ye command .env ko Git ki tracking se hata degi (file laptop mein rahegi, par GitHub se hat jayegi)
git rm --cached .env

# Phir se commit karo
git add .
git commit -m "fix: removed .env from tracking and added .gitignore"
git push origin main
